#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:919
msgid ""
"In <application>Gnumeric</application> all error values have names that "
"start with <code>#</code>. 8 error values are standardized:"
msgstr ""
"I <application>Gnumeric</application> börjar alla felvärden med "
"<code>#</code>. Åtta felvärden är standardiserade:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:951
msgid ""
"The result of specifying an intersecting range that in fact does "
"<emphasis>not</emphasis> intersect."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet när ett angivet skärningsområde i själva verket "
"<emphasis>inte</emphasis> skär varandra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:956
msgid ""
"A formula could not be evaluated because an invalid number was used as "
"argument, for example <code>=SQRT(-1)</code>"
msgstr ""
"Formeln kunde inte beräknas eftersom ett ogiltigt tal användes som argument,"
" till exempel <code>=SQRT(-1)</code>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:965
msgid ""
"Usually the result of importing an unrecognized error from a different file "
"format."
msgstr ""
"Visas vanligtvis när ett okänt fel importeras från ett annat filformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:970
msgid ""
"A formula could not be evaluated because the wrong type of argument was "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Formeln kunde inte beräknas eftersom ett argument av fel typ användes."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"There are several ways to add data into a spreadsheet. The simplest data "
"entry technique involves typing the data into a spreadsheet by hand. This is"
" usually necessary the first time that data are introduced into a computer. "
"If the data already exist in a computer file of some kind, a simple way "
"might exist to insert these data into a <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"worksheet. If the data are in a text file, they can be inserted into a "
"worksheet rapidly using the text conversion facilities. If data exist in a "
"spreadsheet file of a different format, <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"may be able to open the file and the data can then be copied where they are "
"wanted."
msgstr ""
"Det finns flera sätt att lägga in data i ett kalkylblad. Det enklaste är att"
" skriva in dem för hand, vilket oftast behövs när data matas in i en dator "
"för första gången. Om data redan finns i en fil kan det finnas ett enkelt "
"sätt att föra in dem i ett <application>Gnumeric</application>-kalkylblad. "
"Textfiler kan snabbt importeras med verktygen för textkonvertering. Om data "
"finns i ett kalkylblad med ett annat filformat kan "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kanske öppna filen, så att du sedan kan "
"kopiera data dit de behövs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:18
msgid ""
"This section explains how to enter data by hand into a spreadsheet. The "
"techniques necessary to obtain data from other computer sources are "
"explained in <xref linkend=\"chapter-files\"/> which deals with external "
"data sources."
msgstr ""
"Det här avsnittet beskriver hur du matar in data för hand i ett kalkylblad. "
"Hur du hämtar data från andra källor beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"chapter-"
"files\"/>, som handlar om externa datakällor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:26
msgid ""
"If the information being entered into <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"cannot be interpreted correctly, <application>Gnumeric</application> will "
"display an error message. The user may then be forced to edit the data "
"before continuing. For example, a formula may be mathematically incorrect if"
" the user has two operators in a row (e.g. =3+*4) and the dialog will give "
"the user the chance to re-edit the entry or accept the entry as text rather "
"than as a formula. When the formula is corrected, the leading apostrophe can"
" be removed and <application>Gnumeric</application> will re-interpret the "
"entry as a formula."
msgstr ""
"Om <application>Gnumeric</application> inte kan tolka inmatad information "
"korrekt visar <application>Gnumeric</application> ett felmeddelande. Du kan "
"behöva redigera data innan du fortsätter. En formel blir till exempel "
"matematiskt felaktig om två operatorer står efter varandra (till exempel "
"=3+*4). Dialogrutan låter dig då redigera inmatningen eller godta den som "
"text i stället för som formel. När formeln har rättats kan du ta bort den "
"inledande apostrofen, så tolkar <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"inmatningen som en formel igen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:44
msgid ""
"The simplest method to place data in a spreadsheet involves selecting the "
"location for the data, typing the data on a keyboard and then typing the "
"<keysym>Enter</keysym> key to finish the input."
msgstr ""
"Det enklaste sättet att lägga in data är att markera en cell, skriva in data"
" med tangentbordet och trycka på <keysym>Enter</keysym> för att avsluta "
"inmatningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:54
msgid ""
"Select the cell where you want to enter data by clicking on it with the "
"white cross cursor. This will place the thick `selection' box around that "
"cell."
msgstr ""
"Klicka med den vita korspekaren på cellen där du vill mata in data. En tjock"
" markeringsram visas runt cellen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:62
msgid ""
"Type in the data or formula. The details of this step are presented below "
"for each of the five types of data which can be entered."
msgstr ""
"Skriv in data eller en formel. Nedan beskrivs hur du gör för var och en av "
"de fem datatyperna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:70
msgid ""
"Press the <keysym>Enter</keysym> key. This will complete the input and move "
"the selection box down one cell which will then be able to receive further "
"input."
msgstr ""
"Tryck på <keysym>Enter</keysym>. Då avslutas inmatningen och markeringen "
"flyttas ned en cell, så att du kan fortsätta mata in data."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:79
msgid ""
"At any time while entering the data and before the <keysym>Enter</keysym> is"
" pressed, the user can cancel the data entry by typing the "
"<keysym>Esc</keysym> key. This will return the spreadsheet to the selection "
"mode and restore the contents previously in the selected cell."
msgstr ""
"Du kan när som helst innan du trycker på <keysym>Enter</keysym> avbryta "
"inmatningen genom att trycka på <keysym>Esc</keysym>. Då återgår "
"kalkylbladet till markeringsläget och cellens tidigare innehåll återställs."
